  "hints": [
    "Every move costs the same (one more cell), so this is an unweighted shortest path: breadth-first search.",
    "Start the BFS at (0, 0) with distance 1, and try all 8 neighbours of each cell, including the diagonals. Skip cells that are 1 or already visited.",
    "Mark a cell as visited when you push it, not when you pop it, so no cell enters the queue twice. Check first that the start and end cells are both 0."
